              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe ubabuza gusambana, weho ntusambana? Wewe wanka ibishushanyo vy’ibigirwamana, weho ntiwiba ivyo mu nsengero zavyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
