            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Non’ ūtākebge ni yitondera ibibgirijwe n’ivyagezwe, mbega kudakebga kwiwe ntikuzomuharūrwako nko gukebga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
